{
  "repo": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-LASER",
  "ecosystem": "hydra",
  "tagline": "Three independent safeguards decide whether a laser cell may take work; the bridge can never fire the laser.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-LASER reads the key switch, the enclosure and the interlock over three separate GPIO lines and the state of a GRBL laser controller, builds a safety snapshot, passes every job through the shared evaluate_job gate of HYDRA-UMC-SDK and answers over MQTT. It coordinates auxiliaries only: it cannot arm or fire a laser.",
